bones.description:
Bone name mapping for the preset. Keys depend on preset type:
IK_ARM: {ik_bone, pole_target, chain_count}
IK_LEG: {ik_bone, pole_target, foot_bone, chain_count}
PISTON_PAIR: {bone_a, bone_b}
WHEEL_SPIN: {wheel_bone, axis}
DOOR_SWING: {hinge_bone, min_angle, max_angle, axis}
TURRET_TRACK: {base_bone, elevation_bone, target_bone}
